WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:07.776
"Do you know where Bud is?" Ringo asked.

2
00:00:07.777 --> 00:00:14.454
"Yes. Our drone found him," Lou said.

3
00:00:14.455 --> 00:00:17.294
He showed Ringo his phone.

4
00:00:17.295 --> 00:00:20.105
Ringo saw Bud on the screen.

5
00:00:20.106 --> 00:00:24.021
Moon sand came up to Bud's knees.

6
00:00:24.022 --> 00:00:27.656
"Help!" he cried.

7
00:00:27.657 --> 00:00:31.216
"I'll get the rover," Ringo said.

8
00:00:31.217 --> 00:00:33.399
He turned toward the spaceship.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.943
Suddenly—

10
00:00:38.944 --> 00:00:42.058
vroom! The rover shot out of the

11
00:00:42.059 --> 00:00:45.491
base. Spark was driving the

12
00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:53.685
rover! Spark sped across the desert.

13
00:00:53.686 --> 00:01:00.360
"Woo-hoo!" He drove up a big

14
00:01:00.361 --> 00:01:07.140
hill. Two big ears popped

15
00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:22.027
up. "Uh-oh!" Spark

16
00:01:22.028 --> 00:01:30.125
cried. Ringo gasped. "The bunny is chasing Spark!"

17
00:01:30.126 --> 00:01:34.346
Lou gulped. "Oh boy."

18
00:01:34.347 --> 00:01:38.364
"We need to stop the bunny!" Ringo cried.

19
00:01:38.365 --> 00:01:42.928
"Bunnies like moon roots," Bot said.

20
00:01:42.929 --> 00:01:47.743
"We don't have any," Lou said.

21
00:01:47.744 --> 00:01:52.055
"Bot, can you trick the bunny?" Ringo asked.

22
00:01:52.056 --> 00:01:56.082
"Yes! Good idea!" Bot said.

23
00:01:56.083 --> 00:02:00.268
Bing! She shined a picture in the air.

24
00:02:00.269 --> 00:02:03.606
It was a big moon root.

25
00:02:03.607 --> 00:02:08.626
"Hop on!" Bot said to Ringo.

26
00:02:08.627 --> 00:02:11.408
"What about me?" Lou asked.

27
00:02:11.409 --> 00:02:14.002
"I have to save Bud."

28
00:02:14.003 --> 00:02:18.107
"I can't take both of you," Bot said.

29
00:02:18.108 --> 00:02:20.641
"Don't worry," Ringo said.

30
00:02:20.642 --> 00:02:29.859
"We'll save Spark—and Bud!"

